*[[Colombia national football team|Colombia]] advanced to play [[Uruguay national football team|Uruguay]] (runner-up of [[2014 FIFA World Cup Group D|Group D]]) in the [[2014 FIFA World Cup knockout stage#Colombia vs Uruguay|round of 16]].
